OL,3,GNEWSASon who used AI to help save mum's
OL,4,Alife hopes case offers Parkinson's
OL,5,Aclues
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn NHS doctor who says he saved his
OL,8,Fmum's life with the help of AI hopes
OL,9,Fwhat he learned can help others with
OL,10,FParkinson's Disease complications.
OL,12,FEd Patrick, an anaesthetist from
OL,13,FOxfordshire, was at his mother's
OL,14,Fbedside in hospital ready to say his
OL,15,Fgoodbyes after she began suffering
OL,16,Fserious and continuous seizures.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
PN,33902
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1790927750
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASon who used AI to help save mum's
OL,4,Alife hopes case offers Parkinson's
OL,5,Aclues
OL,6,
OL,7,FUsing AI to scour recent medical
OL,8,Fjournal articles, he said he identified
OL,9,Fa vitamin deficiency linked to her
OL,10,FParkinson's medication as a possible
OL,11,Fcause, and staff then gave her a
OL,12,Fvitamin dose that appeared to stop the
OL,13,Fseizures.
OL,15,FDoctors say clinical trials are needed
OL,16,Fto understand more - and warn against
OL,17,Fpatients making changes to their own
OL,18,Fmedication without medical advice.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
